   "page": "results/leela",
   "lead": "Rivals, then a gap",
   "text": "Leela beat Stockfish in the TCEC superfinals of Seasons 15 and 17, and Stockfish has won every TCEC season since Season 18, according to Wikipedia.",
   "section": "Synapses",
   "links": [
