  },
  {
   "id": "evid/alphazero-2017#1",
   "page": "evid/alphazero-2017",
   "lead": "A December 2017 preprint",
   "text": "On 5 December 2017 DeepMind posted a preprint reporting that AlphaZero reached superhuman chess within 24 hours of self-play and defeated a world-champion program.",
   "section": "Synapses",
   "links": [],
   "cites": [
