  },
  {
   "id": "evid/alphazero-2017#2",
   "page": "evid/alphazero-2017",
   "lead": "No losses in 100 games",
   "text": "According to Wikipedia, AlphaZero scored 28 wins and 72 draws with no losses in 100 games against Stockfish 8 from the starting position.",
   "section": "Synapses",
   "links": [],
   "cites": [
    "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stockfish_(chess)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "evid/alphazero-2017#3",
   "page": "evid/alphazero-2017",
   "lead": "The conditions questioned",
   "text": "Tord Romstad, one of Stockfish's original authors, pointed out that the games used a fixed one minute per move, a year-old version, untested thread counts and hash tables that were too small.",
