  },
  {
   "id": "evid/alphazero-2018#1",
   "page": "evid/alphazero-2018",
   "lead": "Three hours a game",
   "text": "DeepMind's 2018 matches used three hours per game plus 15 seconds per move, with Stockfish on 44 CPU cores as in the TCEC championship.",
