  },
  {
   "id": "evid/alphazero-2018#2",
   "page": "evid/alphazero-2018",
   "lead": "155 wins, 6 losses",
   "text": "Against the 2016 TCEC champion version of Stockfish, AlphaZero won 155 games and lost 6 out of 1,000.",
   "section": "Synapses",
   "links": [],
