   "page": "open/chessbase",
   "lead": "A 2021 lawsuit",
   "text": "In 2021 Stockfish developers sued ChessBase in Germany, saying its Fat Fritz 2 and Houdini 6 products were Stockfish derivatives sold without the GPL's source-code rights.",
