   "page": "open/chessbase",
   "lead": "Settled in 2022",
   "text": "In November 2022 the two sides announced an agreement ending the case, which Tord Romstad and Stéphane Nicolet had filed at the District Court Munich I; ChessBase agreed to stop selling products with Stockfish code for a time and to appoint a Free Software Compliance Officer.",
